      ":question/problem": "A chef is preparing $6$ different pasta stations for a food festival. Each station will serve either Recipe X or Recipe Y, but not both. Recipe X uses $5$ ounces of cheese per station, and Recipe Y uses $3$ ounces of cheese per station. If $r$ stations will be set up for Recipe X and the remaining stations will be set up for Recipe Y, which of the following expressions represents the total number of ounces of cheese the chef will need?"
